note as BIZ_diagram_51_promotions
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  The rewards and discount engine end users asked for: loyalty programs with tiers and a
  points ledger, promotions with flexible discount rules, single/multi-use coupons and
  promo codes with redemption tracking, app-usage rewards (earn points/credits for booking,
  completing courses, referrals, streaks), and a referral program. Discounts apply at
  checkout (module 42 payments / 17 billing) and credits settle into wallets
  (module 42B). Fully auditable; abuse-resistant by construction.
end note

