note as DEP_diagram_51_promotions
  Connects to other modules via:
  directory.tenants, iam.users, payments.payment_intents (redemptions apply at checkout),
  payments.wallets (credit awards settle to a rewards wallet via 42B), billing.invoices,
  marketing.campaigns (campaign_ref_id), messaging.domain_events (earning_rules consume app
  events: booking_completed, course_completed, referral_qualified), terminology.catalog_concepts.
end note

note as REC_DERIVED_diagram_51_promotions
  REC 3.3 — DERIVED BALANCES
  loyalty_memberships.points_balance/lifetime_points and current_tier_id are DERIVED
  projections of the append-only points_ledger_entries (source of truth); maintain by trigger
  with balance_after. coupons.redemption_count and promotions budget consumption are derived
  and gate further redemptions.
end note

note as HARDENING_diagram_51_promotions
  REC 3.4 — HARDENING (enforce at DDL)
  - points_ledger_entries: append-only; UNIQUE(idempotency_key); PARTITION BY recorded_at;
    CHECK points > 0. Earning is idempotent per (earning_rule, source_ref) to stop double-award.
  - loyalty_memberships: UNIQUE(loyalty_program_id, member_type_concept_id, member_ref_id).
  - coupons: UNIQUE(code); redemptions enforce per_user_limit & total_redemption_limit (trigger).
  - redemptions: partial UNIQUE(coupon_id, redeemer_ref_id) when coupon single-use-per-user.
  - member_referrals: UNIQUE(referral_code); CHECK referrer_user_id <> referee_user_id (no self-referral).
end note

note as VALUE_SETS_diagram_51_promotions
  VALUE SETS (bind *_concept_id; do not hardcode)
  program_type->vs_loyalty_type{points,cashback,tiered,visits,hybrid};
  expiry_policy->vs_points_expiry{never,fixed_days,rolling,end_of_year};
  member_type/redeemer_type->vs_reward_member{patient,practitioner,user,contact};
  direction->vs_points_direction{earn,redeem,expire,adjust,transfer};
  reason->vs_points_reason{booking,purchase,course_completion,referral,streak,review,signup,manual};
  event_type->vs_app_event{app_open,booking_completed,payment_completed,course_completed,referral_qualified,review_posted};
  award_type->vs_award_type{points,wallet_credit,discount,free_item};
  period->vs_period{day,week,month,lifetime};
  promotion_type->vs_promotion_type{percentage_off,fixed_off,bogo,free_shipping,bundle,first_purchase,app_usage};
  discount_type->vs_discount_type{percentage,fixed,bogo,tiered};
  applies_to->vs_discount_target{order,service,product,category,subscription,booking};
  coupon_type->vs_coupon_type{public,single_use,personal,batch};
  qualifying_event->vs_referral_qualifier{signup,first_booking,first_payment,course_enroll};
  status/state->vs_lifecycle_state.
end note


